                               PROSPECTUS SUMMARY

         The following is only a summary which highlights some information from
this prospectus. It may not include all of the information that is important to
you. To understand this offering fully, you should read the entire prospectus
carefully, including the risk factors and the financial statements. For short
definitions of terms used, see the glossary at the end of this prospectus.

Our Company

         Commonwealth Income & Growth Fund IV is a Pennsylvania limited
partnership that will own and lease computer peripheral equipment. Our office is
at 1160 West Swedesford Road, Suite 340, Berwyn, PA. Our phone number is
1-800-249-3700. We refer to Commonwealth Income & Growth Fund IV as the
partnership in this prospectus. Our business strategy is as follows:

         o        We will use a substantial portion of the proceeds of the
                  offering to acquire computer peripheral and other similar
                  equipment, which will be leased to U.S. corporations and other
                  institutions.
         o        We will also use excess cash flow, sale proceeds and the
                  proceeds of debt financing to purchase additional equipment
                  from time to time throughout our operational phase. We expect
                  that most of the equipment will be placed on operating leases
                  (short term leases under which we will normally receive rental
                  payments in an amount less than the purchase price of the
                  equipment).
         o        At the end of initial operating leases, we will either
                  re-lease or sell equipment. Substantially all of the equipment
                  will be manufactured by, or compatible with equipment
                  manufactured by IBM. See "Risk Factors" and "Investment
                  Objectives" and "Description of Leases."
         o        We intend to purchase only equipment which will be leased at
                  the same time we acquire the equipment.
         o        We intend to dispose of all our assets in approximately 10
                  years from the termination of this offering.

General Partner

         Our general partner is Commonwealth Income & Growth Fund, Inc., located
at 1160 West Swedesford Road, Berwyn, Pennsylvania 19312 (telephone number is
610-647-6800). The general partner is responsible for managing our affairs on a
day-to-day basis. The general partner is also responsible for identifying and
making investments on our behalf. Our general partner is owned by Commonwealth
of Delaware, Inc., which is owned by Commonwealth Capital Corp., ("Com Cap
Corp."). Affiliates (individuals or entities considered to be in control of,
controlled by, or under common control with a specified person or entity) of our
general partner have sponsored several prior equipment leasing programs. See
"Conflicts of Interest" and "Table II -- Prior Performance Tables."

