expense that might be paid by the partnership might be considered to be
investment interest expense and, as such, would be subject to the limitations
described herein. Because the amount of any limited partner's investment
interest that would be subject to disallowance in any year will depend upon the
other investment income and expenses of that limited partner, the extent, if
any, of such disallowance will depend upon that limited partner's particular tax
situation.

