employee pension or profit sharing trust or an individual retirement account is
generally exempt from taxation. However, gross UBTI of a tax exempt entity is
subject to tax to the extent that, when combined with all other gross UBTI of
the tax exempt entity for a taxable year, it exceeds all deductions attributable
