the investment of partnership cash balances) generally will not produce UBTI for
a tax exempt entity that invests in the partnership, a portion of such tax
exempt entity's portfolio income from the partnership will constitute UBTI
pursuant to the "debt-financed property" rules if the tax exempt entity finances
its acquisition of units with debt.

